infographic sequence-snake-steps-underline-text
data
  title How Node resolves require(./shapes), in fixed order
  desc First existing path wins; exhaust all 8 probes and it throws MODULE_NOT_FOUND
  sequences
    - label ./shapes
      desc Exact file as written — usually absent
    - label ./shapes.js
      desc First extension probed; a sibling .js always wins
    - label ./shapes.json
      desc Tried only if no .js exists
    - label ./shapes.node
      desc Compiled addon — last extension tried
    - label ./shapes/ as directory
      desc Read package.json main, resolved as a file
    - label ./shapes/index.js
      desc Directory fallback when there is no main
    - label ./shapes/index.json
      desc Next index extension probed
    - label ./shapes/index.node
      desc Last directory probe
    - label MODULE_NOT_FOUND
      desc All probes exhausted — nothing matched
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b
